{"id":"7b280c53db7d1f85","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-sp2.md","title":"Sp2","display":"df-sp2 — Sp2","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-sp2","aliases":["58-df-sp2"],"display":"df-sp2 — Sp2","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-alg-commutative-ring.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-sp2"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-sp2</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sp2 — Sp2"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f6ca290bdbaf9481\" href=\"?note=f6ca290bdbaf9481\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-alg-commutative-ring.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-alg-commutative-ring.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G,R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R\\in V\">\\(G,R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgCommutativeRing}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgCommutativeRing}_S\\)</span> (commutative-unital-ring predicate; see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f6ca290bdbaf9481\" href=\"?note=f6ca290bdbaf9481\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-zfc-alg-commutative-ring.md\">../batch03/58-df-zfc-alg-commutative-ring.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SymplecticGroup2}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SymplecticGroup2}_S\\)</span> (rank-one symplectic-group value relation defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{2\\times2}=\\{A:\\mathrm{Function}(A,2\\times2,R)\\}\">\\(R^{2\\times2}=\\{A:\\mathrm{Function}(A,2\\times2,R)\\}\\)</span>；矩阵坐标通过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\">\\(A(\\langle i,j\\rangle)\\)</span> 求值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sp2}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{SymplecticGroup2}_S(G,R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgCommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land G=\\Bigl\\{A\\in R^{2\\times2}:\\;\n\\cdot(\\langle A(\\langle0,0\\rangle),A(\\langle1,1\\rangle)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}=+\\bigl(\\langle1_R,\\cdot(\\langle A(\\langle0,1\\rangle),A(\\langle1,0\\rangle)\\rangle)\\rangle\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sp2}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{SymplecticGroup2}_S(G,R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgCommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land G=\\Bigl\\{A\\in R^{2\\times2}:\\;\n\\cdot(\\langle A(\\langle0,0\\rangle),A(\\langle1,1\\rangle)\\rangle)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{25mm}=+\\bigl(\\langle1_R,\\cdot(\\langle A(\\langle0,1\\rangle),A(\\langle1,0\\rangle)\\rangle)\\rangle\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The carrier is the explicit set of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\\times2\">\\(2\\times2\\)</span> matrices over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>, so no undeclared <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"GL_2(R)\">\\(GL_2(R)\\)</span> constructor is used. For a commutative unital ring, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^TJA=(\\det A)J\">\\(A^TJA=(\\det A)J\\)</span>; hence the displayed equation forces <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\det A=1_R\">\\(\\det A=1_R\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sp_2(R)=SL_2(R)\">\\(Sp_2(R)=SL_2(R)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-alg-commutative-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"f6ca290bdbaf9481","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-alg-commutative-ring.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-zfc-alg-commutative-ring.md","status":"resolved","id":"f6ca290bdbaf9481","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcAlgCommutativeRing}_S$ (commutative-unital-ring predicate; see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-alg-commutative-ring.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G,R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgCommutativeRing}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SymplecticGroup2}_S","display":false},{"tex":"R^{2\\times2}=\\{A:\\mathrm{Function}(A,2\\times2,R)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A(\\langle i,j\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}sp2}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{SymplecticGroup2}_S(G,R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{ZfcAlgCommutativeRing}_S(R,+,\\cdot,0_R,1_R)\\\\\n&\\land G=\\Bigl\\{A\\in R^{2\\times2}:\\;\n\\cdot(\\langle A(\\langle0,0\\rangle),A(\\langle1,1\\rangle)\\rangle)\\\\\n&\\hspace{25mm}=+\\bigl(\\langle1_R,\\cdot(\\langle A(\\langle0,1\\rangle),A(\\langle1,0\\rangle)\\rangle)\\rangle\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"2\\times2","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"GL_2(R)","display":false},{"tex":"A^TJA=(\\det A)J","display":false},{"tex":"\\det A=1_R","display":false},{"tex":"Sp_2(R)=SL_2(R)","display":false}],"bytes":1306,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1203","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-sp2.md|58-df-sp2]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","f6ca290bdbaf9481"]}